{"about_the_game":"Into the Rhythm VR is a drumming experience brought to virtual reality. You are given drum sticks along with 6 drums. Follow the dropping notes to play the awesome music you always wanted. All you need is a place to sit, and motion controllers to strike with rhythm!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/e4081b37d0abb58f9b8a1ce1988f439e.poster.avif?t=1608732373\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/e4081b37d0abb58f9b8a1ce1988f439e.webm?t=1608732373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/e4081b37d0abb58f9b8a1ce1988f439e.mp4?t=1608732373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Just because they are shaped like drums, it doesn't mean you have to play drums! EDM? Heavy Metal? Play any music you like!<br></li><li>We provide with 20 original tracks<br></li><li>Variety of drum sticks and drum sets<br></li><li>Not satisfied with just 20 songs? Don't worry we provide you with the editor to create your own tracks both on your computer and VR!<br></li><li>With the tools we provide, you can insert music that you like, and make the drums play the sound that you want!<br></li><li>Once you finish creating your beautiful tracks, you can choose to share them with the world! </li></ul><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VR Editor</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/1e3d284a333627c3dbe8c236f5c1fb41.avif?t=1608732373\" width=616 height=308 /></span><br><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2D Editor</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/86396a7b1f1aa6645b029a6f9a9bbfac.avif?t=1608732373\" width=616 height=308 /></span><br><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extra Drum Sets</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/082d29e0a8673af0f8730633beeddb78.poster.avif?t=1608732373\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/082d29e0a8673af0f8730633beeddb78.webm?t=1608732373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/082d29e0a8673af0f8730633beeddb78.mp4?t=1608732373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"bf36bc5e5db66b6ff8947bc373681f263d4d1037.jpg","localized_name":"Give me a beat","name":"Give me a beat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/677060/bf36bc5e5db66b6ff8947bc373681f263d4d1037.jpg"},{"icon":"84d7279754878a30e60bcbd0335513fe6efd51e2.jpg","localized_name":"I am maniac","name":"I am maniac","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/677060/84d7279754878a30e60bcbd0335513fe6efd51e2.jpg"},{"icon":"5b664d75fc9703dba579c40cef1a5ba54746f000.jpg","localized_name":"La Musique!","name":"La Musique!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/677060/5b664d75fc9703dba579c40cef1a5ba54746f000.jpg"},{"icon":"c6d37b25413372ae1ef88f5a714dc4de176496c8.jpg","localized_name":"Mission 1 Cleared [S]","name":"Mission 1 Cleared [S]","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/677060/c6d37b25413372ae1ef88f5a714dc4de176496c8.jpg"},{"icon":"fa2cf85db07cd4ad2b8684323d1e924cf9c0d388.jpg","localized_name":"Mission 2 Cleared [S]","name":"Mission 2 Cleared [S]","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/677060/fa2cf85db07cd4ad2b8684323d1e924cf9c0d388.jpg"},{"icon":"38d823c6af727ba241634b5e3cea7ad6d40efacb.jpg","localized_name":"Mission 3 Cleared [S]","name":"Mission 3 Cleared [S]","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/677060/38d823c6af727ba241634b5e3cea7ad6d40efacb.jpg"},{"icon":"a9435c8ec8a52d771dde37fe534cb10da5578538.jpg","localized_name":"Mission 4 Cleared [S]","name":"Mission 4 Cleared [S]","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/677060/a9435c8ec8a52d771dde37fe534cb10da5578538.jpg"},{"icon":"87fadf6af6663a54ecf61d31982c7649953b29b4.jpg","localized_name":"Mission 5 Cleared [S]","name":"Mission 5 Cleared [S]","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/677060/87fadf6af6663a54ecf61d31982c7649953b29b4.jpg"},{"icon":"1feeca2e0ba63294b0f7e7c7320f555ae4bd180d.jpg","localized_name":"Master","name":"Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/677060/1feeca2e0ba63294b0f7e7c7320f555ae4bd180d.jpg"},{"icon":"cb81efb63c2a4af3cc78069ae7091cde5e62ef30.jpg","localized_name":"Grand Master","name":"Grand Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/677060/cb81efb63c2a4af3cc78069ae7091cde5e62ef30.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/677060?t=1608732373","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1608732373","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1608732373","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1608732373","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Note for 2020 Winter Update</h1><p>Dear Drummers,<br><br>Welcome to the 2020 winter update of Into the Rhythm VR!<br>As we mentioned, we are bringing you the new features and content.<br>Please see the changes we have made below.<br><br>1. More Speed Options.<br>As we promised, we have added 4 more speed options: x4, x6, x8, x10. With those speed options, we expect you to play difficult levels much easier since you will be able to see the gaps between notes more clearly.<br>Plus, we have implemented memory function which will keep your speed setting in a next round.<br><br>2. Fever System<br>Also, we have added the fever feature that multiplies your score depending on your accuracy. It will be activated when you fulfill the fever gauge on the right in a designated time. The bonus will be increased from x2 to x2.5 and finally x3 by consecutive fever.<br><br>3. Auto Chart (Beta)<br>Enjoy your favorite songs on Into the Rhythm VR without complicated procedures! By putting your .mp3, .wav or .ogg files in the \u2018sounds\u2019 folder, the game will make a chart by itself. We are still improving the algorithms for better accuracy, and will let you know when it works. <br><br>4. Additional Song<br>New track \u2018Carol of the bells - Zero Cover\u2019 is added. Not like previous songs, we focused more on implementing drum patterns, especially in the hard level.  Please share your opinion about it.<br><br>5. Bug fix and optimization.<br>There are many fixes in this update, but below two are the most important parts.<br>a. Key sound issue: Each note in the original tracks will make a sound correctly when you hit it. <br>b. lighting Optimization: We have removed heavy graphic effects and resources, so the workload is significantly reduced(loading time and input latency is reduced as well).<br><br>There are more things coming for you, so stay tuned.<br>Oh, and we wish you a happy X-mas and a new year.<br><br>Thank you</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Into the Rhythm VR is a drumming experience brought to virtual reality. You are given drum sticks along with 6 drums. Follow the dropping notes to play the awesome music you always wanted. All you need is a place to sit, and motion controllers to strike with rhythm!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/e4081b37d0abb58f9b8a1ce1988f439e.poster.avif?t=1608732373\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/e4081b37d0abb58f9b8a1ce1988f439e.webm?t=1608732373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/e4081b37d0abb58f9b8a1ce1988f439e.mp4?t=1608732373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Just because they are shaped like drums, it doesn't mean you have to play drums! EDM? Heavy Metal? Play any music you like!<br></li><li>We provide with 20 original tracks<br></li><li>Variety of drum sticks and drum sets<br></li><li>Not satisfied with just 20 songs? Don't worry we provide you with the editor to create your own tracks both on your computer and VR!<br></li><li>With the tools we provide, you can insert music that you like, and make the drums play the sound that you want!<br></li><li>Once you finish creating your beautiful tracks, you can choose to share them with the world! </li></ul><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VR Editor</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/1e3d284a333627c3dbe8c236f5c1fb41.avif?t=1608732373\" width=616 height=308 /></span><br><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2D Editor</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/86396a7b1f1aa6645b029a6f9a9bbfac.avif?t=1608732373\" width=616 height=308 /></span><br><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extra Drum Sets</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/082d29e0a8673af0f8730633beeddb78.poster.avif?t=1608732373\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/082d29e0a8673af0f8730633beeddb78.webm?t=1608732373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/082d29e0a8673af0f8730633beeddb78.mp4?t=1608732373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","developers":["NTWO Studio Co., Ltd"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/header.jpg?t=1608732373","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"COPYRIGHT\u00a9 2017 NTWO STUDIO CO., LTD. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/677060/323101/a34237aa80a4ba26d027d3123bdc94828562397a/1751129764/dash_av1.mpd?t=1603994592","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/677060/323101/a34237aa80a4ba26d027d3123bdc